  "baseline_commit": "ae05df96b9654803cde5891f9f4cb4a2ec9093ce",
  "description": "All Silver records, including unnamed Passerby Boy and legacy variants, carry all three original Johto starters. Non-Silver trainer data is unchanged.",
  "normalization": "Goldenrod Underground uses the original grass/fire branch level 34 for all three flags; water branch originally used level 32.",
  "replacement_reason": "Keep bat friendship progression, Electric coverage, and Ghost coverage. Remove Sneasel first, then Kadabra/Alakazam only where needed for the six-Pokemon party limit.",
  "partner_note": "Dragon\u2019s Den NPC multi battle uses independent six-slot parties; Silver keeps Crobat and Gengar and adds the other two starters (five Pokemon). Visual party indicators and switching through all five remain gameplay acceptance checks.",
